"""gh-ai — AI-native GitHub CLI. Token-optimized output for LLM consumption.

Covers the full GitHub REST API surface with compact, agent-friendly output:
no URLs, node IDs, avatars, or nested metadata. Lists are one line per item,
views are compact YAML, writes return short confirmations.

Exit codes: 1 input error | 2 network | 3 401 | 4 403 | 5 404 | 6 other HTTP
            7 git failed | 8 git timeout | 9 git not found
"""

